						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hail and well met, everyone.  ;)  As I am sure some of you heard, I stopped playing EQ a while back.  About a week or two before Kaledine, I made the decision to bow out gracefully from the realm of Norrath.  Too many &quot;real life&quot; specifics kept me from playing as much as I would have liked to, thus making my decision up for me to no longer play.<br />
<br />
I had thought about keeping my account open in case I changed my mind and wanted to return, but felt it was best in the long run.  Don't get me wrong, I wouldn't mind playing the game but not like I used to.  I &quot;dabbled&quot; in Dark Age of Camelot for a week or so, after quitting EQ, but had to put a halt to all game playing due to 'real life' getting too hectic.<br />
<br />
I haven't really kept in touch with too many people from EQ, which I am sorry for.  However, I am sure there are some of you who are reading this and asking yourself &quot;who the hell is this Joreth guy anyway?&quot;  =P  I saw a few familiar faces posting on these boards, so I thought I would take a chance and post a little message to let everyone know I was thinking about you guys.  Who knows, perhaps one day in the near future I will return.  As for now, though, it won't be anytime soon.  Maybe when the storm, that is my life, dies down a bit.  =)<br />
<br />
To those of you who wish to keep in contact with me, feel free to email me at joreth_macleod@hotmail.com .  I will check these boards from time to time to see what everyones up to.  Anywho, take care everyone and happy hunting.  ;)<br />
<br />
Warmest Regards,<br />
Joreth Macleod<br />
Joggo Bogglesworth<br />
Elph Meadowlark<br />
(etc etc etc...)						</td>
